Include <stddef.h> for Ghostscript's Windows API declarations in psi/iapi.h.
Patch body copied verbatim from MSYS2's 003-libspectre.patch:
https://github.com/msys2/MINGW-packages/blob/d87e68ae356d773901e5c477854312e5de0548cf/mingw-w64-ghostscript/003-libspectre.patch

Only the filename and descriptive header differ from the cited MSYS2 patch;
the patch body, including its context and hunk positions, is unchanged.

--- a/psi/iapi.h
+++ b/psi/iapi.h
@@ -246,6 +246,7 @@
     int argc, char **argv);
 
 #ifdef __WIN32__
+#include <stddef.h>
 GSDLLEXPORT int GSDLLAPI gsapi_init_with_argsA(void *instance,
     int argc, char **argv);
 
